<p><a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:ab9351ac-068b-4e91-8ee2-4b02db498637" title="Web Q&amp;A" data-linktype="external">Web Q&amp;A:</a>&nbsp;<a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:ab9351ac-068b-4e91-8ee2-4b02db498637" title="XPath, XML Notepad, Data Islands, Case Sensitivity, XSL, and More" data-linktype="external">XPath, XML Notepad, Data Islands, Case Sensitivity, XSL, and More</a></p>
